# into this file.
# Added here: Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail (1452).
# Uldaman (`when dungeon "Uldaman"`, dungeons in the route): for a character who chose it and took Prospector
# Stormpike's The Lost Dwarves and Krom Stoutarm's Reclaimed Treasures (2398, 1360) on the Ironforge stop of
# forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale, the run follows the Stonevault dig, at about 43. Inside, Baelog takes
# 2398 (the run step turns it in at the door's place: the data has none inside) and gives The Hidden Chamber (2240);
# the Discs of Norgannon give The Platinum Discs (2278, 2279) and a
# Shattered Necklace starts The Shattered Necklace (2198). The hand-ins (Stormpike, Krom, High Explorer Magellas,
# then Dinita Stonemantle, and Talvash del Kissel) are on the Ironforge stop of
# forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands (`when complete`/`when onquest`). Left out: Talvash's chain after the
# necklace (2199-2204: five Silver Bars, then a second Uldaman run for the paladin's remains and the gems; the route
# runs Uldaman once). Solution to Doom (709) is on 30-40/06-badlands, behind `when group 709`. The every-quest route
# (`when dungeon "Uldaman" all`) takes Rigglefuzz's Power Stones (2418) in the Valley of Fangs, back to him after the
# run; hands Ryedol's A Sign of Hope (721, from 30-40/06) to Hammertoe Grez at the dig and takes his Amulet of Secrets
# (722, Magregan Deepshadow at the dig's south end) before the door; and hands a Mage's Power in Uldaman (1956) to
# Tabetha on the walk west from Theramore. Left out: Hammertoe's chain on to The Lost Tablets of Will (723-726, 762,
# 1139: Ironforge and Angor Fortress, then a second Uldaman run).
# Zul'Farrak (run in forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris): its every-quest route (`when dungeon "Zul'Farrak" all`)
# hands Tabetha's Task (2861, from 40-50/01's Stormwind stop) to Tabetha on the walk west from Theramore and takes
# her Tiara of the Deep (2846) there.

