step Boss Tho'grun
  tip Boss Tho'grun does not stay at Camp Boff: he walks a long loop around the Badlands with his guards, from the camp in the west along the south of the zone to about 61,69, north to about 49,49 and back west to the camp. The arrow follows his loop west from here until you meet him.
