step Lethlor Ravine
  tip The Scalding Whelps nest in the ravine east of Garek; leave the Scorched Guardians (elite) alone. The Black Drake's Heart drops rarely: take it if it comes while you grind.
  collect 4612 quest 706 optional     -- Black Drake's Heart

