step Uldaman
  when dungeon "Uldaman"
  when onquest 2398,1360,2418,1956
  when level>=42.5
  zone Badlands
  tip Uldaman is a dungeon for a group of five, levels 41 to 51. Its door is a short way east of the dig.
  tip Inside: Baelog, one of the lost dwarves, takes The Lost Dwarves and gives The Hidden Chamber, for Prospector Stormpike; a chest holds Krom Stoutarm's Reclaimed Treasures. Deeper in, the Discs of Norgannon start The Platinum Discs, which go to High Explorer Magellas, and a Shattered Necklace, a drop inside, starts a quest for Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge. The Shadowforge dwarves at the dig and inside drop Rigglefuzz's Power Stones, and the Obsidian Sentinel a Mage's Obsidian Power Source, unless you chose only the quests on your way.
  enter "Uldaman" @44.6,12.1
  turnin 2398 npc 6906 @44.6,12.1     -- Baelog, inside
  complete 1360 @44.6,12.1            -- Reclaimed Treasures: Krom's chest, inside
  collect 8009 x8 quest 2418.1        -- Power Stones: Dentrium, the Shadowforge dwarves
  collect 8052 x8 quest 2418.2        -- An'Alleum, the same dwarves
  collect 8053 quest 1956.1 @44.6,12.1 only Mage -- Power in Uldaman: the Obsidian Sentinel, inside

